00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:21.690
So it's a very simple database.

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:24.940
It has one table
with multiple keys.

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:27.030
And it is two terabytes.

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:29.890
In this case, we've loaded
two terabytes of data.

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:33.000
And we're going to try
and export and import

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:34.220
this database.

00:19:34.220 --> 00:19:37.350
So now you can see, if you're
