00:20:12.220 --> 00:20:14.420
That's what database people are.

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:16.100
And then we choose
the database we want.

00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:17.870
In this case, we want
the YCSB database.

00:20:17.870 --> 00:20:20.840
And then we also want to choose
the compute region for running

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:22.370
the Dataflow compute jobs.

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:26.510
So remember, we're using
