00:22:34.910 --> 00:22:37.310
And there's no magic here.

00:22:37.310 --> 00:22:38.970
Please, no magic.

00:22:38.970 --> 00:22:42.050
But now we're importing
this two terabyte database.

00:22:42.050 --> 00:22:46.640
Again, you can see
the job flow details

00:22:46.640 --> 00:22:49.680
on our handy-dandy
Import/Export tab.

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:51.564
And again, there's
